        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundabout, concrete pavement, surface concrete layer, 0% recycling
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 20b334bc-21d3-44d9-bf62-d06721542935
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 concrete surface layer for roundabout (concrete pavement) in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 260mm, service life 80 years. 0% recycling content
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_20b334bc-21d3-44d9-bf62-d06721542935.xml</text>
